  m_Name: TheBreathingHollow
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::QuestDefinition
  id: thebreathinghollow
  displayName: The Breathing Hollow
  description: 'The roots that closed the road, the roots that choked the portal''s stones, the roots in the breach''s dead: one thing is pushing them, from somewhere deep in the Misty Woods. The portal can feel it breathing, but not where. Find the place on an expedition and come home with the way, and the portal will remember it.'
  chain: The Hearth and the Door
  journalNotes: 'The portal''s briefing tells you when the hollow can be found: it marks the place for the whole raid. Walk into it, then get out alive: a way the portal hasn''t seen brought home doesn''t count.


    Nobody at home has seen it. Bjarne says the woods go quiet near it.'
